    "body": "@dejvid-smth Just to confirm, is this powershell or powershell core?\r\n\r\nI found [this bug](https://github.com/microsoft/terminal/issues/4981) in Windows Terminal, but it looks like it was closed without ever finding the root cause. The exception isn't coming from our code, and I can't think of a place in starship where we redirect input, so my suspicion at the moment is that there's some latent bug in Windows Terminal that the SQLcl + starship combination is triggering. (Maybe someone else will point out an input redirect location and we can look there)",
